flowchart TD
 A[削除tryの例外] --> B{DBConcurrencyException}
 B -->|はい| C[rollback試行・Conflict]
 B -->|いいえ| D{残る対象例外}
 D -->|いいえ| E[catch外へ伝播]
 D -->|はい| F[rollback成否取得]
 F --> G{writeStarted true}
 G -->|いいえ| S[SystemError]
 G -->|はい| H{commitAttempted true}
 H -->|はい| U[Unknown]
 H -->|いいえ| I{rollback成功}
 I -->|はい| S
 I -->|いいえ| U
